      "description": "Encabezado de la app: palotes como marca, pestañas a tiza, pestaña activa invertida.",
      "html": "<header class=\"ds-band\"><div class=\"ds-band-in\"><span class=\"ds-mark\"><svg viewBox=\"-1 0 24 14\" style=\"height:20px;aspect-ratio:25/14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M2.4 1.5L1.6 12.5\"/><path d=\"M6.5 1.5L6.5 12.5\"/><path d=\"M11.4 1.5L10.6 12.5\"/><path d=\"M15.4 1.5L15.4 12.5\"/><path d=\"M0 11L17 3\"/></svg><span>Rutina</span></span><nav class=\"ds-nav\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"ds-nav-link\" aria-current=\"page\">Hoy</a><a href=\"#\" class=\"ds-nav-link\">Hábitos</a><a href=\"#\" class=\"ds-nav-link\">Tareas</a></nav></div></header>",
      "css": ".ds-band{background:var(--malbec,#4a1530);color:var(--chalk,#f3f1f4);font-family:var(--font-archivo, Archivo), sans-serif} .ds-band-in{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:12px 16px 0} .ds-mark{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.025em;padding-left:8px} .ds-nav{display:flex;gap:4px} .ds-nav-link{display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:0 12px;border-radius:.4rem;font-size:.875rem;color:rgb(243 241 244 / .8);text-decoration:none;transition:background-color .15s,color .15s} .ds-nav-link:hover{background:rgb(243 241 244 / .1);color:var(--chalk,#f3f1f4)} .ds-nav-link:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--chalk,#f3f1f4)} .ds-nav-link[aria-current=page]{background:var(--chalk,#f3f1f4);color:var(--malbec,#4a1530);font-weight:600}"
    },
